# Reverse proxy for the Bookstore production stack.
#
# Caddy terminates TLS (automatic Let's Encrypt) and forwards everything to the
# Angular SSR Node server. The app itself sets security headers (helmet), gzip
# and rate-limits /api/recommend, and trusts exactly one proxy hop — this Caddy.
#
# SITE_ADDRESS is injected from .env (your domain or the <ip>.sslip.io host).

{$SITE_ADDRESS} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy app:4000
}
